// M3	Medium
// M4	Medium
// M5	Medium
// The most urgent fixes are C1 (float suffix), C2 (table resize), and C3/C4 (UTF-8/escape validation) — these are silent correctness bugs that will produce wrong results on valid input. D1 (Unicode tables) is the largest design debt — the hardcoded ranges are fundamentally unmaintainable.
